# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Python (guard hook tooling, if any local runs)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/

# NOTE: the loop ledger (queue.md / progress.md / issue-<N>.plan.md) lives in the
# CONSUMING project under its LEDGER_ROOT. As of 2026-07-28 this repo is ALSO a
# consumer -- it dogfoods the plugin it develops -- so a ledger does live here and
# is ignored below. `.claude/loop.config.md` (the binding seam) IS committed.

# dev-loop ledger (local working state, never committed)
.claude/loop/

# social/marketing drafts (local working state, never committed)
social/

# OG-card build intermediates. Only `og-card.png` is committed -- the publisher
# resolves that one file and nothing reads the other two, so committing them just
# invites drift from the brief they were built from. The renderer writes all three
# alongside the brief, which lives in a COMMITTED directory, so without these rules
# they show up untracked and get swept in by a wide `git add`. Cards themselves are
# deliberately NOT ignored: `posts/images/<slug>/og-card.png` is committed, per D014.
posts/images/**/og-card.svg
posts/images/**/og-card@2x.png

# Node (the Prettier gate on posts/ -- root package.json, CI-only, never shipped)
node_modules/
